Cell["\<\
When the complete finite group is already known, getGenerator looks for a \
smaller set whose products recover every group element.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"502be7b9-1daf-445f-817d-b974ee3809ba"],

Cell["\<\
Supply the complete group, its identity, and its multiplication law. The \
function does not infer a product from the appearance of the elements. The \
name is retained so that existing notebooks continue to run.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5fe798e5-ca2b-4bb4-bbe8-008d2ce3750d"],

